        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000508"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Vrchní oční víčko je umístěné 3 mm a níž než obvykle a zakrývá vrchní část duhovky (objektivně), nebo okraj vrchního víčka zakrývá alespoň část čočky (subjektivně)</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The upper eyelid margin is positioned 3 mm or more lower than usual and covers the superior portion of the iris (objective); or, the upper lid margin obscures at least part of the pupil (subjective).</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000508"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Üst göz kapağı sınırı normalden 3 mm veya daha fazla aşağıya yerleşmiş ve irisin üst kısmını kapatmakta (nesnel); veya üst kapak sınırı en azından pupilin bir kısımını kapatır (öznel)</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The upper eyelid margin is positioned 3 mm or more lower than usual and covers the superior portion of the iris (objective); or, the upper lid margin obscures at least part of the pupil (subjective).</babelon:source_value>
