        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Abnormality of prenatal development or birth</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0001197</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Because of the close link between prenatal developmental abnormalities and abnormalities of the birth process, a single term is chosen to subsume both classes of abnormality.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="cs">Abnormalita prenatálního vývoje nebo narození</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="nl">Afwijking van prenatale ontwikkeling of geboorte</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Anomalie du développement prénatal ou de la naissance</rdfs:label>
