        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A type of weakness of a skeletal muscle in the neck that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of strength with repetitive muscle actions.</babelon:source_value>
