        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Oral kavite olarak da bilinen ağzın herhangi bir yapısal anomalisi</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any structural anomaly of the mouth, which is also known as the oral cavity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
